Material from PM4Py
-------------------

Minera's behaviour is tested against PM4Py 2.7.22
(https://github.com/process-intelligence-solutions/pm4py), which inspired this
project. PM4Py is Copyright (C) Process Intelligence Solutions UG
(haftungsbeschränkt) and is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public
License, version 3 or later.

So that Minera's output matches the reference, some of its files reproduce
text from PM4Py:

- language-model prompt and description templates in
  src/backend/original_model_context.cpp, src/backend/llm_abstractions.cpp,
  src/backend/llm_context.cpp, src/backend/llm_injection.cpp and
  src/backend/case_description.cpp;
- SAP and Camunda extraction queries in
  src/backend/database_history_queries.hpp;
- error and warning messages in the importers, filters and reference-
  compatible implementations;
- captured reference outputs, including documentation strings, in the test
  fixtures under src/ and in the evidence files under docs/.

PM4Py itself is not included in this repository and is not needed to build or
run Minera. Minera is an independent project and is not affiliated with or
endorsed by the PM4Py developers.


